  "cmd.about": "Aegis keeps your Telegram groups and channels safe and lively — free.\n\n🛡 Anti-spam, anti-raid, captcha, flood and link guards, 42 locks\n⚙️ Setup wizard, notes, filters, welcome messages, warnings and logs\n📢 Channels: scheduled posts, join requests, admins vote on direct messages\n📊 Statistics, points, contests and polls\n🎲 100 fun features: games, fortune telling, fonts\n\nAdd Aegis to your group as an admin, then send /config.",
