  "dreamlist.m_blood": "Life energy and strong emotion; sometimes tiredness that needs rest.",
  "dreamlist.m_book": "Knowledge and wisdom you are looking for.",
  "dreamlist.m_bread": "Basic needs, work and blessing; sharing bread: generosity.",
  "dreamlist.m_bridge": "A transition — moving from one stage of life to the next.",
  "dreamlist.m_butterfly": "Transformation and lightness; you are changing for the better.",
  "dreamlist.m_car": "How you steer your life. Driving yourself: control; a passenger: letting others decide.",
  "dreamlist.m_cat": "Independence, intuition and mystery. Trust your instincts about a situation.",
  "dreamlist.m_chased": "Avoiding a problem or a feeling. What you run from often wants to be faced.",
  "dreamlist.m_clothes": "The role you show to others; new clothes: a new image.",
  "dreamlist.m_crying": "Release; in folk belief, often joy that follows sadness.",
  "dreamlist.m_dark": "The unknown or fears you have not looked at yet.",
  "dreamlist.m_death": "Rarely about real death: an ending that makes room for something new.",
  "dreamlist.m_desert": "Loneliness or a dry spell before renewal.",
  "dreamlist.m_doctor": "Healing and the need to take care of yourself.",
  "dreamlist.m_dog": "Loyalty and friendship. A friendly dog: support near you; an angry one: a conflict with a friend.",
