  "gamelist.eo_0": "Search the desk|Look behind the painting|Try the window",
  "gamelist.eo_1": "Light the candle near the painting|Try the window",
  "gamelist.eo_2": "Try the code 1-2-3|Go back to the desk",
  "gamelist.eo_3": "Search the desk|Look behind the painting",
  "gamelist.eo_4": "Open the safe with 7-4-1|Try the window again",
  "gamelist.eo_5": "Look around the room again",
  "gamelist.eo_6": "The door of the room|The window",
  "gamelist.er_0": "You wake up in a locked room. There is an old desk, a large painting and a small window.",
  "gamelist.er_1": "In the desk drawer you find a candle and a note: «Light shows the way».",
  "gamelist.er_2": "Behind the painting is a small safe with a three-digit lock.",
  "gamelist.er_3": "The window is nailed shut. Outside, it is dark and quiet.",
  "gamelist.er_4": "In the candlelight, three numbers glow on the painting: 7 – 4 – 1.",
  "gamelist.er_5": "Wrong code. The safe beeps angrily, and nothing happens.",
  "gamelist.er_6": "The safe opens! Inside is an old key and a riddle: «I have a lock but no chest». Where does the key go?",
  "gamelist.er_7": "🎉 The key turns in the door lock with a click — you escaped!",
  "gamelist.er_8": "The key does not fit the window… the candle goes out. Try again!",
  "gamelist.gq_0": "Is it a mammal?",
  "gamelist.gq_1": "Can it fly?",
  "gamelist.gq_10": "Is it an insect?",
  "gamelist.gq_11": "Is it known for being fast?",
  "gamelist.gq_2": "Does it live in water?",
  "gamelist.gq_3": "Is it bigger than a person?",
  "gamelist.gq_4": "Does it eat meat?",
  "gamelist.gq_5": "Is it a pet that lives with people?",
  "gamelist.gq_6": "Is it a farm animal?",
  "gamelist.gq_7": "Does it have stripes or spots?",
  "gamelist.gq_8": "Does it live in Africa?",
  "gamelist.gq_9": "Does it have four legs?",
  "gamelist.pw_job": "an astronaut on Mars|a pastry chef in Paris|a lighthouse keeper|a dragon trainer|a famous detective|a ship captain|the inventor of flying cars|the librarian of a magic library|a rock star|the owner of a cat café|a deep-sea explorer|a guide for time travellers",
  "gamelist.pw_pet": "a tiny dragon|a talking parrot|a very polite penguin|a lazy cat who can read|a fox in a hat|a giant tortoise|a flying fish|a unicorn who hates rain|a robot dog|an owl who gives advice|a dolphin|a small cloud that follows you",
  "gamelist.pw_place": "a city on the clouds|an island of cats|a floating market|a village under the sea|a castle in Scotland|a space station|a tree house in the jungle|Isfahan in the year 3000|a train that never stops|a desert oasis|a snowy cabin in Siberia|a giant library",
  "gamelist.pw_power": "talk with animals|become invisible for one minute a day|fly, but only slowly|never get lost|cook anything perfectly|read any book in a second|make plants grow|stop time for five seconds|understand every language|find lost things|feel rested after one hour of sleep|make anyone laugh",
  "gamelist.pw_twist": "you are famous for your terrible singing|you have a twin who is your exact opposite|you are never late — not even once|you collect strange socks|you have never seen rain|your best friend is your old teacher|the poems you write come true|you keep finding treasure by accident|you run a secret club|you are afraid of butterflies|everyone asks you for advice|you won a pie-eating contest",
