  "group.anon_admin": "🕶 You're posting anonymously, so Aegis can't tell who you are. Turn «Remain anonymous» off for a moment, or send «پیکربندی» / config in Aegis's private chat to see all your chats.",
  "group.basic_group": "ℹ️ This is a basic group: Telegram lets bots appoint admins and restrict members only in supergroups. Telegram turns it into a supergroup when you, for example, make it public or show chat history to new members — Aegis follows the change automatically.",
