  "group.help_admins": "<b>Admins</b> (as a reply, or with @username or an id)\n/warn · /mute · /restrict · /kick · /ban, and /unwarn · /unmute · /unrestrict · /unban\n/lockdown · /readonly — emergency locks\n«پنل» / panel or /config — all of Aegis’s settings for this group, in private",
  "group.help_members": "<b>Everyone</b>\n/rules — the rules (rules · قوانین)\n/report — report a message to the admins, as a reply (report · گزارش)\n/admins — the admins (admins · ادمین ها)\n/mywarns — your warnings (mywarns · اخطارهای من)\n/me · /top — your points and the leaderboard\n/ask — a question to the admins (پرسش از مدیران)\n/fun — games and fun · /fal — fortune telling · /font — fonts\n<i>Some of these may be turned off by the admins.</i>",
