  "ptest.dstyle_q7": "I decide quickly, in the moment.",
  "ptest.dstyle_q8": "I often make choices on impulse.",
  "ptest.dstyle_r0": "Rational|You decide with facts and careful thought. Remember that feelings are data too.",
  "ptest.dstyle_r1": "Intuitive|You trust your inner sense, and it is often right. For big choices, check it against a few facts.",
  "ptest.dstyle_r2": "Collaborative|You like to decide with others’ advice. Great — just make sure the final choice is yours.",
  "ptest.dstyle_r3": "Spontaneous|You decide fast and in the moment. For important things, sleep on it one night.",
  "ptest.energy_q1": "I wake up feeling rested.",
  "ptest.energy_q2": "I have the energy to do what I care about.",
  "ptest.energy_q3": "The people around me leave me feeling lighter.",
  "ptest.energy_q4": "I rest before I am exhausted.",
  "ptest.energy_q5": "I move my body most days.",
  "ptest.energy_q6": "I feel calm more often than stressed.",
  "ptest.energy_r0": "Running low|Your battery needs care. Sleep, water, a walk and less screen time will make a real difference this week.",
  "ptest.energy_r1": "Balanced|Your energy is mostly steady. Notice what drains you and do a little less of it.",
  "ptest.energy_r2": "Radiant|Your energy is high and others feel it. Share it — and keep resting so it lasts.",
  "ptest.ennea_q1": "I hold myself to high standards and notice what is wrong.",
  "ptest.ennea_q2": "I feel good when I help others and am needed.",
  "ptest.ennea_q3": "Success and being recognised matter a lot to me.",
  "ptest.ennea_q4": "I feel different from others and value deep, true feelings.",
  "ptest.ennea_q5": "I need time alone to think and understand things fully.",
  "ptest.ennea_q6": "I think about what could go wrong and value loyalty and security.",
  "ptest.ennea_q7": "I love new experiences and keep my options open.",
  "ptest.ennea_q8": "I am direct, I take charge and I protect the people I care about.",
  "ptest.ennea_q9": "I avoid conflict and like peace and harmony around me.",
  "ptest.ennea_r0": "The Reformer|Principled and honest; you want to make things right. Remember that good enough is sometimes enough.",
  "ptest.ennea_r1": "The Helper|Warm and generous; people feel cared for around you. Let others care for you too.",
  "ptest.ennea_r2": "The Achiever|Driven and adaptable; you turn goals into results. Your worth is more than your wins.",
  "ptest.ennea_r3": "The Individualist|Creative and sensitive; you see beauty others miss. Your feelings are a gift, not a burden.",
  "ptest.ennea_r4": "The Investigator|Curious and insightful; you understand things deeply. Share what you know — people want to hear it.",
  "ptest.ennea_r5": "The Loyalist|Reliable and responsible; you are a true friend. Trust yourself as much as others trust you.",
  "ptest.ennea_r6": "The Enthusiast|Joyful and spontaneous; you bring energy everywhere. Depth can be as exciting as novelty.",
  "ptest.ennea_r7": "The Challenger|Strong and protective; you stand up for what is right. Gentleness is a strength too.",
  "ptest.ennea_r8": "The Peacemaker|Calm and accepting; you bring people together. Your own wishes matter as much as theirs.",
  "ptest.eq_o1": "I ask if everything is okay|I say it is fine but feel annoyed|I stop making plans with them",
  "ptest.eq_o2": "I notice it and wait before I speak|I say something sharp|I stay quiet and let it build up",
  "ptest.eq_o3": "I ignore it; it is their business|I gently ask if they want to talk|I tell a joke to change the mood",
  "ptest.eq_o4": "I look for what is useful in it|I defend myself right away|I feel hurt for days",
  "ptest.eq_o5": "I name the feeling and make a plan|I distract myself until the last minute|I panic and give up",
  "ptest.eq_o6": "I take the side of the one I like more|I help each one say what they need|I leave the room",
  "ptest.eq_o7": "I tell them to cheer up|I sit with them and listen|I wait until they get over it",
  "ptest.eq_o8": "I apologise and try to repair it|I explain why it was not my fault|I avoid them for a while",
